# MCP Configuration Template

This is an example only. Do not use it unchanged. Do not commit secrets or machine-specific paths.

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "playwright": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["@playwright/mcp@latest"]
    },
    "fetch": {
      "command": "uvx",
      "args": ["mcp-server-fetch"]
    },
    "memory": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "@modelcontextprotocol/server-memory"],
      "env": {
        "MEMORY_FILE_PATH": "REPLACE_WITH_A_LOCAL_PATH_OUTSIDE_THIS_REPOSITORY"
      }
    },
    "filesystem": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": [
        "-y",
        "@modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem",
        "REPLACE_WITH_THE_ABSOLUTE_PATH_TO_THIS_REPOSITORY"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Only add GitHub, Roblox Studio, or Blender after following their current official setup instructions. Do not commit the real configuration if it contains local paths, tokens, or private endpoints.
